index 88b7a44..31122b3 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -17,6 +17,8 @@ bin/serve
 
 `bin/serve` prepares the SQLite databases and assets, binds to all interfaces, and runs in the foreground. The moderator area is at `/moderate`; readiness is reported at `/up`.
 
+Quiz settings can apply a per-question timer. The countdown is persisted from each question's opening time, finishes timed questions automatically, and is not included in quiz exports.
+
 All databases and uploaded data stay in `storage/`. The app uses local assets and makes no external-service calls.
 
